# CloudHost247 HostX exception register (machine readable).
#
# Consumed by scripts/branding-audit.py, which is wired into
# scripts/release-candidate-check.sh and
# .github/workflows/independent-foundation.yml. Any HostX match — in file
# content OR in a file/directory name — that is not covered by a rule below
# fails the release candidate.
#
# Adding a rule is a deliberate, reviewed act. It must carry a reason code and
# must be reflected in docs/BRANDING-COMPATIBILITY.md, which explains the
# constraint in prose.
#
# Line format — five fields separated by TABs ('#' starts a comment):
#
#   content<TAB><path-glob><TAB><token-regex><TAB><reason-code><TAB><note>
#   path<TAB><path-glob><TAB>-<TAB><reason-code><TAB><note>
#
# <path-glob>  matched against the repository-relative path. '*' does not cross
#              a directory separator, '**' does.
# <token-regex> matched case-sensitively (with re.search) against the matched
#              HostX token. Use ANY to allow every token in that file — that is
#              reserved for migration inputs, integrity baselines, historical
#              records, the registers and the auditor itself.
#
# Reason codes:
#   IONCUBE    ionCube-encoded vendor bytecode; the identifier is baked in and
#              cannot change without a rebranded build from the vendor
#   ADDON-CTL  contract emitted or consumed by the encoded addon at runtime
#              (Smarty bindings, AJAX class names, CSS selectors, table names)
#   DB-STORED  the value is stored in the live database by the encoded addon;
#              renaming the file needs a matching data migration first
#   MIGRATION  an old value a migration must spell to move away from it
#   DETECTOR   a read-only detector or auditor; it must name what it looks for
#   BASELINE   historical integrity manifest / branding-override list
#   RECORD     historical rename or audit record describing the previous state
#   ASSERTION  a test asserting the legacy identifier is absent
#   REGISTER   this register and the human-readable register document

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. The ionCube-encoded page-builder addon (docs/BRANDING-COMPATIBILITY.md §1)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
path	modules/addons/hostx/**	-	IONCUBE	vendor addon tree; the directory name is the WHMCS addon module ID and the 63 PHP files inside are encrypted bytecode (skipped by the content scan)
content	modules/addons/hostx/assets/js/script.js	^HostxPage$	ADDON-CTL	AJAX class resolved by the encoded includes/ajax.php
content	modules/addons/hostx/assets/css/style.css	^hostx$	ADDON-CTL	inner-box-tool-tip-hostx selector emitted by the encoded admin pages

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Runtime contracts of the encoded addon (§2, §3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/**	^hostx_(theme_settings|blocks)\.?[A-Za-z0-9_]*$|^hostxcurrentpagelink$	ADDON-CTL	Smarty bindings assigned by the encoded hooks.php
content	templates/orderforms/cloudhost247_legacy/**	^hostx_(theme_settings|blocks)\.?[A-Za-z0-9_]*$	ADDON-CTL	Smarty bindings assigned by the encoded hooks.php
content	*.php	^hostx_(pages|page_products|setting|dynmic_translation)$|^hostx/defaultmenu\.php$	ADDON-CTL	tables owned and queried by the encoded addon, plus its menu include

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Block slugs and banner filenames stored in the database by the addon (§4)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
path	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/includes/blocks/hostx_web_hosting.tpl	-	DB-STORED	rendered from a slug stored by the encoded page builder
path	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/includes/blocks/hostx_web_hosting_2.tpl	-	DB-STORED	rendered from a slug stored by the encoded page builder
path	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/includes/blocks/why_hostx.tpl	-	DB-STORED	rendered from a slug stored by the encoded page builder
path	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/banners/*-hostx.png	-	DB-STORED	banner filename stored by the encoded banner manager
path	templates/cloudhost247_legacy/banners/*-hostx.webp	-	DB-STORED	banner filename stored by the encoded banner manager

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Migration inputs, detectors and the auditor itself
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content	scripts/migrate-legacy-names-to-cloudhost247.sql	ANY	MIGRATION	spells the old values it renames away from
content	scripts/audit-legacy-branding-in-database.sql	ANY	DETECTOR	read-only detector; names what it looks for
content	scripts/branding-audit.py	ANY	DETECTOR	the auditor's own search pattern

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Integrity baselines, registers and historical records
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content	docs/independent-rebuild/original-file-manifest.sha256	ANY	BASELINE	SHA-256 inventory of the vendor-derived tree
content	docs/independent-rebuild/rebrand-overrides.list	ANY	BASELINE	branding-only exceptions to the baseline
content	docs/independent-rebuild/rebrand-overrides.sha256	ANY	BASELINE	hashes of those exceptions
content	docs/independent-rebuild/branding-exceptions.list	ANY	REGISTER	this register
content	docs/BRANDING-COMPATIBILITY.md	ANY	REGISTER	the human-readable exception register
content	docs/independent-rebuild/BRAND-RENAME.md	ANY	RECORD	rename completion record
content	docs/pre-restructuring-audit.md	^hostx/?$	RECORD	pre-restructuring inventory line
content	docs/RESTRUCTURING.md	^hostx/?$|^hostx_$	RECORD	restructuring map and ionCube requirement note
content	docs/independent-rebuild/AUDIT-AND-PARITY-MATRIX.md	^hostx/?$|^hostx_$|^hostx_(blocks|theme_settings)$|^Hostx(Page|Block|Banner)$	RECORD	records the encoded addon's compatibility names
content	docs/independent-rebuild/INSTALLATION-AND-UPGRADE.md	^hostx/?$|^hostx_$	RECORD	retained encoded-addon path and mod_hostx_* note
content	docs/independent-rebuild/API-INVENTORY-AUDIT.md	^hostx$	RECORD	vendor ionCube licence-loader inventory
content	docs/independent-rebuild/STAGING-TEST-MATRIX.md	^HostX$	ASSERTION	row CH247E-29 asserts no HostX identifier is visible
content	README.md	^hostx/?$	RECORD	documents the retained vendor addon directory
content	README.md	^(HostX|HOSTX|Hostx|Host X|HOST X|host-x|HOST-X|host_x|host x)$	DETECTOR	the Branding section lists exactly which spellings scripts/branding-audit.py rejects

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Tests that pin the rename
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content	tests/security/test_security.py	^Hostx-?$|^hostx_email_?(action)?$	ASSERTION	negative assertions pinning the module rename
content	tests/cloudhost247_email/run.php	^hostx_email$	ASSERTION	negative assertion pinning the module rename
